WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.931 --> 00:00:10.928
- [Peter] Apparently, I'm grown up,

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.588
but I still go to places

00:00:12.588 --> 00:00:15.755
that I've always dreamt of as a child.

00:00:17.159 --> 00:00:18.574
I grew up on a farm,

00:00:18.574 --> 00:00:21.094
so there were really no
other kids to play with.

00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:23.365
So I ended up just going
into my imagination.

00:00:23.365 --> 00:00:26.457
My world is full of
futuristic superheroes,

00:00:26.457 --> 00:00:29.957
laser beams, spaceships, and constructions.

00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:35.779
I thought I'd be an inventor

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.398
so I became an engineer

00:00:39.398 --> 00:00:41.655
but the imagination
isn't really encouraged

00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:44.164
when you're an engineer.

00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:47.331
Luckily, I found my own path.

00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:50.631
I try to maintain that
sense of magic and wonder

00:00:50.631 --> 00:00:53.048
that we often lose as adults.

00:00:54.035 --> 00:00:56.952
(electronic music)

00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:03.894
I can actually be myself in this costume.

00:01:03.894 --> 00:01:06.594
I'm kind of expected to
be unique and unusual,

00:01:06.594 --> 00:01:08.636
which suits me fine.

00:01:08.636 --> 00:01:11.219
(upbeat music)

00:01:31.053 --> 00:01:33.549
I found this place to
go to on a Monday night.

00:01:33.549 --> 00:01:36.216
Everyone goes crazy in the dark.

00:01:40.015 --> 00:01:41.128
I could actually shed some light

00:01:41.128 --> 00:01:43.010
on something you don't normally see,

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.343
splitting audio.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:49.301
- [Male] Welcome to No
Lights, No Light Crowd.

00:01:49.301 --> 00:01:51.884
(upbeat music)

00:01:54.518 --> 00:01:55.736
- [Peter] So when the lights go out,

00:01:55.736 --> 00:01:57.207
no one's watching you.

00:01:57.207 --> 00:01:59.532
You know, you can get away
with whatever you want.

00:01:59.532 --> 00:02:02.115
(upbeat music)

00:02:10.355 --> 00:02:12.833
It feels like you are in some music video.

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:15.818
It feels like everyone around
you is an amazing dancer,

00:02:15.818 --> 00:02:18.401
super sexy, fantastically cool.

00:02:21.433 --> 00:02:24.428
(applause)

00:02:24.428 --> 00:02:26.197
When the lights come back on,

00:02:26.197 --> 00:02:29.665
some sort of transformation has happened.

00:02:29.665 --> 00:02:32.415
I don't know what they've
been doing there in the dark,

00:02:32.415 --> 00:02:34.613
you hear it and you're a part of it

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:39.364
but I love the way you can't
see the transformation.

00:02:39.364 --> 00:02:42.105
The feeling I get when
I'm dancing in the dark,

00:02:42.105 --> 00:02:44.002
when you're free and
connected with your body

00:02:44.002 --> 00:02:45.373
and with the community,

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:49.540
has basically been the
driving force behind my art.

